  RowBox[{"Phi4", ".", "pars"}]],
  FontSize->13,ExpressionUUID->"d2209cee-d00b-e840-b8f4-331e718361c8"],
 StyleBox[" sets the wave-function, mass and coupling renormalization factors \
to 1, so no counterterm diagrams appear at this stage. The parameters are \
identified as ",
