    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->13,ExpressionUUID->"c0b84cd3-2eaa-604d-a229-f4c895bb1358"],
 StyleBox[" is the unrescaled quartic coupling. It is not the rescaled \
coupling ",
  FontSize->13],
