    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->13,ExpressionUUID->"f173127e-82c8-9440-889b-24198ec4a39a"],
 StyleBox["\n\nAfter the rotation the denominator is positive definite, so \
