a702bf1aaa58"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Question:",
  FontSize->13,
  FontSlant->"Italic",
  FontColor->RGBColor[
   0.5254901960784314, 0.3843137254901961, 0.49019607843137253`]],
 StyleBox["\nWhich two-loop graphs are 1PI, what is the sunset\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s p\.b2 pole, and why do subdivergence counterterms not \
affect it?\n",
  FontSize->13],
 StyleBox["-------------------------------------------------------------------\
------------------------------------------------------------------------------\
