    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->13,ExpressionUUID->"1a73df2f-aba4-0c4e-b878-6d77b6f42f12"],
 StyleBox[", reported by Straub.\n\nOur theoretical predictions are obtained \
by evaluating the two-loop ",
  FontSize->13],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["\[Epsilon]", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
