    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->13,ExpressionUUID->"973f6b71-d4ce-bd48-a7f7-08091ed2b94c"],
 StyleBox[" with a small coefficient, so the neglected terms are comparable \
in size. In particular, the discrepancy in ",
  FontSize->13],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["\[Eta]", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\eta", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->13,ExpressionUUID->"f12e0108-00c8-2442-b551-610f99650883"],
 StyleBox[" is relevant to the predicted critical scattering power law, \
whereas the comparison of ",
  FontSize->13],
 Cell[BoxData[
